Bili Mate — neonatal jaundice clinical decision support

This product includes content from NICE guideline CG98 (Jaundice in newborn
babies under 28 days), used under the NICE UK Open Content Licence
(https://www.nice.org.uk/reusing-our-content/nice-uk-open-content-licence).
NICE guidance is prepared for the National Health Service in England, was
accurate at the source update date recorded in the embedded rule pack, and
may be updated or withdrawn. NICE has not endorsed, and is not responsible
for, Bili Mate.

Intended for registered healthcare professionals in the United Kingdom only.
Output is advisory and requires review by a suitably trained healthcare
professional before action. This software is not authorised for clinical use
unless the release gates in spec/08-clinical-safety-and-regulation.md are
complete.
